      "solution": "import torch\n\n\ndef linear(x, w, b):\n    X = torch.tensor(x, dtype=torch.float32)\n    W = torch.tensor(w, dtype=torch.float32)\n    return X @ W + torch.tensor(b, dtype=torch.float32)\n",
